  "details": "Before release 2026.3.1, when enabling Steady cam, adjusting user in-game brightness in VRChat would only affect the VR user's perspective, not the steady cam/stream view which is displayed on the desktop pc monitor. After this update, adjusting brightness with steady cam enabled now affects the steady cam/stream view on pc desktop monitor in addition to the VR user.\n\nThe way it was PRIOR to update was helpful so that my brightness was adjust and not make things too dim for viewers of my stream/steady cam view.",
